{"q":"82","t":"Remove Duplicates from Sorted List II","d":"Medium","p":false,"c":"<p>Given the <code>head</code> of a sorted linked list, <em>delete all nodes that have duplicate numbers, leaving only distinct numbers from the original list</em>. Return <em>the linked list <strong>sorted</strong> as well</em>.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/img/60d71287d3b6933f.jpg\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 142px;\" />\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> head = [1,2,3,3,4,4,5]\n<strong>Output:</strong> [1,2,5]\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"/assets/img/79cc606f00cba120.jpg\" style=\"width: 500px; height: 205px;\" />\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> head = [1,1,1,2,3]\n<strong>Output:</strong> [2,3]\n</pre>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>The number of nodes in the list is in the range <code>[0, 300]</code>.</li>\n\t<li><code>-100 &lt;= Node.val &lt;= 100</code></li>\n\t<li>The list is guaranteed to be <strong>sorted</strong> in ascending order.</li>\n</ul>\n","h":[],"m":"{\r\n  \"name\": \"deleteDuplicates\",\r\n  \"params\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"head\",\r\n      \"type\": \"ListNode\",\r\n      \"dealloc\": false\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"return\": {\r\n    \"type\": \"ListNode\",\r\n    \"dealloc\": true\r\n  }\r\n}","g":[{"name":"Linked List","slug":"linked-list"},{"name":"Two Pointers","slug":"two-pointers"}],"s":[{"t":"Remove Duplicates from Sorted List","s":"remove-duplicates-from-sorted-list","d":"Easy","p":false},{"t":"Remove Duplicates From an Unsorted Linked List","s":"remove-duplicates-from-an-unsorted-linked-list","d":"Medium","p":false}],"co":[["Google","google"],["Amazon","amazon"],["Bloomberg","bloomberg"],["Arista Networks","arista-networks"],["Apple","apple"],["Meta","facebook"],["Oracle","oracle"]],"cs":{"a":[["Amazon","amazon",4],["Google","google",3]],"b":[["Bloomberg","bloomberg",3],["Meta","facebook",2]],"m":[["Microsoft","microsoft",8],["Arista Networks","arista-networks",3],["Oracle","oracle",2],["TikTok","tiktok",2],["Nvidia","nvidia",2],["BlackBuck","blackbuck",2]]}}